{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/8/868709a232c1b453ca165ecdf6c7324ac35eb9e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{-8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3bacaeb54098c2290f963ac13d69db6dfc4eb25b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad 2 \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad \\pm 2 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad -2 \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad 4 \\quad \\text{(E)} \\quad 2\\sqrt[3]{-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"403\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e16300c8c2b577ad410d912a64d95105c980967.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{-8} = \\boxed{\\text{(C)} \\quad -2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"147\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span><